    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag and documentation management:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Attach a valid FASTag to the transport vehicle, record the tag number, and update the shipment manifest. Ensure all paperwork—including the owner’s consent, insurance copy, and IRCTC booking reference—is signed and scanned. Accurate FASTag handling speeds up toll clearance for long‑haul routes.</p>
