    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Final verification and handover:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Perform a walk‑around inspection, confirm that the digital audit matches the physical condition, and obtain the customer’s signature on the handover form. This final checkpoint seals the process for any bike parcel service or rail‑based shipment, guaranteeing accountability from pick‑up to delivery.</p>
