<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>At the core of this infrastructure are specialized enclosed hydraulic ramp carriers, which utilize synchronized lift mechanisms to elevate motorcycles onto climate-controlled trailers with zero manual intervention.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>These carriers feature aerodynamic shrouding that reduces wind shear and protects against highway debris, ensuring structural integrity across long-haul corridors.</span></li></ul>
<p>Each unit is secured using individual steel wheel-lock chocks, precision-machined to immobilize both front and rear tires while distributing load forces evenly across the chassis. Complementing this foundation is a high-tensile ratchet lashing system, calibrated to apply consistent clamping pressure that neutralizes longitudinal and lateral oscillations during highway transit.</p>
